-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Atlantis Shrine Wizard triggers all equipped ",{"i":"Sprite-Coat_of_Arms.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:coat-of-arms"}," ",{"t":"Coat of Arms","r":"weapon:coat-of-arms"}," weapons when overhealing by +32. When overhealing by +32 the hidden ",{"i":"Sprite-Acquazzone.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:acquazzone"}," ",{"t":"Acquazzone","r":"weapon:acquazzone"}," will begin to rise from bottom of the screen, with small increases in height after each instance of +32 overhealing. This effect is capped at 50% the height of the screen."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["An easy way to achieve max height with his passive is to use ",{"i":"Sprite-Lifesign_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:lifesign-scan"}," ",{"t":"Lifesign Scan","r":"weapon:lifesign-scan"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Pummarola.png","w":18,"h":15,"r":"passive:pummarola"}," ",{"t":"Pummarola","r":"passive:pummarola"}," with the Arcana ",{"i":"Sprite-Sarabande_of_Healing_(VI).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"}," ",{"t":"Sarabande of Healing (VI)","r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Atlantis_Shrine_Wizard.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Atlantis Shrine Wizard's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Atlantis_Shrine_Wizard.gif","w":107,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 16 April 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fix invisible Flood weapon for Ferryman and Atlantis Shrine Wizard"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}